# The head of an NPC as its likeness sheet frames it, to lay next to the sheet's Cycles tiles
# (reports/content/2026-11-npc-pipeline/likeness.md, "Blender и игра"): front and profile from 120 cm, where the
# game's lens bends a face little (the sheet's camera is orthographic), in the torch light of Xardas' tower and with
# the noon sun in the face; then the same front from 70 and from 38 cm, the close-up of npc-head-look, for what the
# lens does. The head is small at 120 cm: shoot in a large window.
#   TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=3840x2160 BENCH_HOST=ryzen OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=<content root of the head> \
#     scripts/bench.sh npc-head-sheet <out dir>
# @timeout 480
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 12 0
blink off
overlay off
view clean 30
watch nearest
freeze nearest
wait 500
place 110 0
wait 800
watch player
cam cut
cam face 120 0 1
wait 2500
shot tower_front
wait 400
cam cut
cam face 120 90 1
wait 1200
shot tower_profile
wait 400
cam cut
goto pos 7900 270 -4350
watch player
wait 4000
turn 180
wait 2500
cam cut
cam face 120 0 1
wait 2500
shot sunface_front
wait 400
cam cut
cam face 120 90 1
wait 1200
shot sunface_profile
wait 400
cam cut
cam face 70 0 1
wait 1200
shot sunface_front70
wait 400
cam cut
cam face 38 0 1
wait 1200
shot sunface_close
wait 400
